          {
            "time": "Afternoon",
            "activity": "Arrive in Moab, the adventure capital of Utah. Check into your accommodation and relax after the drive."
          },
          {
            "time": "Food",
            "activity": "Dinner at Moab Diner, a classic American diner with kid-friendly options and milkshakes."
